      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote",
        "cnr_id": "comfyui_dagthomas"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Cut Plan\n\nThe scenes are decided **before** anything is written: Load Audio → **Cut Plan** → the writer's `cut_plan` socket. The node measures the song's form (chorus / verse / bridge, downbeats when clear), folds in the Sound Events list, and returns every scene with its start and end on the H3 frame grid - shown on the node, one line per scene, with the reason for each cut (`drop lands here`, `section start`, `your tap`, ...).\n\n- `min_seconds` / `max_seconds` on THIS node are the scene bounds now; the writer's own segment widgets are greyed out while the socket is linked.\n- **🎮 Tap the cuts** plays the song here in the browser: press space where the video should cut, *Apply*, and your taps become hard boundaries (snapped to the nearest onset).\n- The plan is text: edit a time or delete a line and the writer follows.\n- Paste the same lyrics here as in the writer if you want lyric-aware cuts."
      ],
      "title": "Cut Plan",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
